# /hunt — Customer-First Revenue Engine (v1)

## PURPOSE

Find a SPECIFIC group of people with VERIFIED pain, design an offer that solves it, generate copy-paste sales scripts.

**This is NOT stage0.** Stage0 = model classifier (scans internet for known business models, ranks them). Hunt = pain verifier (starts from customer complaints, ends at sales scripts). They complement each other:
- Stage0 answers: "What business model fits my constraints?"
- Hunt answers: "Who has pain I can solve, and will they pay?"

**Philosophy:** No Google "business model" searches. No IndieHackers lists. No "top 10 micro-SaaS ideas." Only: real complaints from real forums, verified by real human outreach.

## INPUTS

```
/hunt <prey description>          # Direct: "/hunt kế toán thuế cá nhân tại VN"
/hunt                             # Interactive: asks 3 questions
/hunt continue <hunt_id>          # Resume after human proof step
```

## EXECUTION CONTRACT

Follow `hunt-checklist.md` step by step. This file provides detailed instructions per step.

